    ('national-gulf-islands-national-park-reserve', 'Gulf Islands National Park Reserve', 'national', 48.66552, -123.407929, 'Gulf Islands', 'Across the southern Gulf Islands, this reserve protects island habitats and small marine areas in the Salish Sea. Sheltered channels support seals, otters, orcas and porpoises, while eagles and seabirds pass above the water.', 'https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/bc/gulf', 'Parks Canada', NULL, NULL),
