    ('provincial-gibson-marine-park', 'Gibson Marine Park', 'provincial', 49.263648, -126.073275, 'Central Island', 'This marine park beside Flores Island Park has sheltered anchorage in Matilda Inlet and a natural warm spring on the shore. A historic, unmaintained route connects the spring area with the sandy beaches at Whitesand Cove.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '693', NULL),
