    ('provincial-hathayim-marine-park-a-k-a-von-donop-marine-park', 'Háthayim Marine Park', 'provincial', 50.17642, -124.960916, 'Discovery Islands', 'Also known as Von Donop Marine Park, Háthayim is a long, sheltered inlet on Cortes Island and a favored anchorage for boaters exploring the Discovery Islands. This undeveloped marine wilderness includes lakes, estuaries, a saltwater lagoon and old-growth forest, with wilderness camping permitted.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '728', NULL),
