    ('provincial-hitchie-creek-park', 'Hitchie Creek Park', 'provincial', 48.795521, -124.739988, 'South Island', 'Within the Nitinat Lake watershed, Hitchie Creek protects lowland old-growth rainforest and river and lake habitats. The creek corridor supports wildlife movement and a wide range of plants and animals.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '748', NULL),
