    ('provincial-sandwell-park', 'Sandwell Park', 'provincial', 49.186401, -123.816833, 'Gulf Islands', 'A short wooded walk on Gabriola Island ends at a picnic area above a sandy beach with views across the Strait of Georgia. At low tide, visitors can reach a sandstone petroglyph east of the day-use area.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '1026', NULL),
