    ('provincial-small-inlet-marine-park', 'Small Inlet Marine Park', 'provincial', 50.255539, -125.284259, 'Discovery Islands', 'At Quadra Island''s north end, Small Inlet offers a protected anchorage near tidal rapids and a route to Newton Lake. A rough trail reaches the lake, and a longer portage links the park to Waiatt Bay in Octopus Islands Marine Park.', 'https://catalogue.data.gov.bc.ca/dataset/parks-ecological-reserves-and-protected-areas', 'BC Parks / DataBC — TANTALIS protected areas', '1097', NULL),
